SVGs are fetched at build time from jsDelivr into frontend/.cache/flag-src:
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/svg/

`npm run flags:raster` maps these faces into a project-owned waving
silhouette with restrained fold lighting. It writes square, Apple-like em
tiles for compact (12 / 24 / 36 px) and body (14 / 28 / 42 px) rendering to
frontend/public/flags/. No Apple artwork or font data is included.
